{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google宣佈將於2027年對其智能家居生態進行重大調整，逐步淘汰長期服務於Nest設備的Nest應用，同時結束Google Assistant在智能音箱和智能顯示屏上的運行。未來，這些產品將統一轉向基於人工智能技術打造的Gemini for Home平台。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587326.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T18:44:25.185961+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T18:27:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T18:37:34.823964+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T18:37:34.823964+00:00","content_hash":"d450826ac45551845e9b248b5d23248bbccfe3d60f0977bbf59970a376510d47","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}